  "slug": "hearty-multigrain-bread",
  "name": "Hearty Multigrain Bread",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This hearty multigrain bread is easy to make in your bread machine. Enjoy the finished loaf for sandwiches or alongside any meal with softened butter.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place water, butter, salt, sunflower seeds, sesame seeds, flax seeds, millet, quinoa, bread flour, wheat flour, milk powder, brown sugar, and yeast into a bread machine in the order listed, or follow the order recommended by the manufacturer if different. Run Basic cycle. Remove loaf from the machine after the cycle is done, 2 hours and 55 minutes."
    }
  ],
